.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-decrypt 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-decrypt \- Decrypts a Message
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop decrypt\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-key\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-session\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-password\fR] [\fB\-\-verifications\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-verify\-with\fR] [\fB\-\-verify\-not\-before\fR] [\fB\-\-verify\-not\-after\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIKEYS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Decrypts a Message
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-key\-out\fR \fI<SESSION_KEY_OUT>\fR
Write the session key here
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-session\-key\fR \fI<WITH_SESSION_KEY>\fR
Try to decrypt with this session key
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-password\fR \fI<WITH_PASSWORD>\fR
Try to decrypt with this password
.TP
\fB\-\-verifications\-out\fR \fI<VERIFICATIONS_OUT>\fR
Write verification result here
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\-with\fR \fI<VERIFY_WITH>\fR
Certs for verification
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\-not\-before\fR \fI<VERIFY_NOT_BEFORE>\fR
Consider signatures before this date invalid
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\-not\-after\fR \fI<VERIFY_NOT_AFTER>\fR
Consider signatures after this date invalid
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Try to decrypt the encryption KEYS with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIKEYS\fR]
Try to decrypt with these keys
